WEBVTT

00:01:28.835 --> 00:01:30.419
to always want more.

00:01:31.838 --> 00:01:35.216
And it satisfies our insatiable appetites

00:01:35.216 --> 00:01:39.095
to discover, buy, collect, show off.

00:01:39.137 --> 00:01:42.181
In truth, fashion
is intrinsic to who we are.

00:01:43.224 --> 00:01:45.101
There is a piece of good news, though.

00:01:45.143 --> 00:01:47.270
We can make fashion sustainable,

00:01:47.311 --> 00:01:49.147
and we're going to do it with science,

00:01:49.147 --> 00:01:52.150
and we're going to do it
not by changing the humans,

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.485
but by changing
those materials themselves.

00:01:54.527 --> 00:01:56.445
And lucky for us,

00:01:56.487 --> 00:01:59.073
the answers to all of fashion's
materials problems

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:02.076
are available today, out there in nature,